  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17; (formerly Env-Hw 104.22, renumbered by #12920) (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100); (formerly Env-Hw 104.23, renumbered by #13405) (See Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) (formerly Env-Hw 104.25)",
